    "zh": "第19课。",
    "zh_hant": "第19課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Tired and thirsty.",
    "start": 2.791,
    "end": 5.132,
    "zh": "又累又渴。",
    "zh_hant": "又累又渴。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.213,
    "end": 9.295,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 9.075,
    "end": 11.095,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Why do the children thank their mother?",
    "start": 12.236,
    "end": 15.878,
    "zh": "为什么孩子们感谢他们的妈妈？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼孩子們感謝他們的媽媽？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "What's the matter children?",
    "start": 17.919,
    "end": 20.14,
    "zh": "孩子们，怎么了？",
    "zh_hant": "孩子們，怎麼了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "We're tired ...",
    "start": 20.781,
    "end": 22.43,
    "zh": "我们累了……",
    "zh_hant": "我們累了……"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "...",
    "start": 22.08,
    "end": 22.71,
    "zh": "……",
    "zh_hant": "……"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "and thirsty Mum.",
    "start": 22.662,
    "end": 24.802,
    "zh": "而且渴了，妈妈。",
    "zh_hant": "而且渴了，媽媽。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Sit down here.",
    "start": 25.263,
    "end": 27.004,
    "zh": "在这儿坐下。",
    "zh_hant": "在這兒坐下。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Are you all right now?",
    "start": 27.804,
    "end": 29.905,
    "zh": "现在你们还好吗？",
    "zh_hant": "現在你們還好嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "No we aren't.",
    "start": 30.125,
    "end": 32.186,
    "zh": "不好。",
    "zh_hant": "不好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Look!",
    "start": 32.487,
    "end": 33.487,
    "zh": "看！",
    "zh_hant": "看！"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "There's an ice cream man.",
    "start": 33.587,
    "end": 36.208,
    "zh": "有个卖冰淇淋的人。",
    "zh_hant": "有個賣冰淇淋的人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Two ice cream please.",
    "start": 36.869,
    "end": 39.63,
    "zh": "请来两个冰淇淋。",
    "zh_hant": "請來兩個冰淇淋。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Here you are children.",
    "start": 40.611,
    "end": 42.793,
    "zh": "给你们，孩子们。",
    "zh_hant": "給你們，孩子們。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Thanks Mum.",
    "start": 43.595,
    "end": 45.397,
    "zh": "谢谢，妈妈。",
    "zh_hant": "謝謝，媽媽。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "These ice creams are nice.",
    "start": 45.998,
    "end": 49.121,
    "zh": "这些冰淇淋很好吃。",
    "zh_hant": "這些冰淇淋很好吃。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Are you all right now?",
    "start": 49.782,
    "end": 52.004,
    "zh": "现在你们还好吗？",
    "zh_hant": "現在你們還好嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Yes we are thank you!",
    "start": 52.786,
    "end": 56.49,
    "zh": "好，我们很好，谢谢！",
    "zh_hant": "好，我們很好，謝謝！"
  }
]
